    LLM: 'On your turn, you must play a card that matches either the **Suit** or the **Rank** of the top card on the discard pile. If you cannot play, you must draw one card from the deck. If that card is playable, you may play it immediately.',
    Player: 'On your turn, you must play a card that matches either the **Suit** or the **Rank** of the top card on the discard pile. If you cannot play, you must draw one card from the deck. If that card is playable, you may play it immediately.',
    objective: 'Be the first player to shed all cards from your hand in a round. The ultimate goal is to win the round and implement a rule that benefits you or hinders your rivals.',
